<title>KUWAIT: Gulf Arab cable project complete in July - agency.</title>
<headline>Gulf Arab cable project complete in July - agency.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>An $80 million project to lay a submerged communications cable linking Kuwait, Qatar, Bahrain and the United Arab Emirates (UAE) will be completed in July, the official Kuwait News Agency said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The cable will provide video, audio, data and fax communications with a capacity of 60,000 circuits between each two of the four Gulf Arab states.</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia, the largest of the six Gulf Arab states, has applied to join the project through a ground line with Kuwait, said the agency without giving further details.</p>
<p>It said the cable will have a service life of 25 years.</p>
</text>
